          "id": "6996d2ab039e66ade375857d",
          "question": "<p>An experiment yields&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> mutually exclusive and exhaustive events \\( A, B \\) and \\( C \\). If \\( P(A)=2 P(B)=3P \\) \\( (C) \\), then \\( \\mathrm{P}(\\mathrm{A}) \\) is equal to</p>",
          "image_url": null,
